{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47689","headline":"三字诀 · 吕岩","name":"三字诀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"这个道，非常道。\n性命根，生死窍。\n说着丑，行着妙。\n人人憎，个个笑。\n大关键，在颠倒。\n莫厌秽，莫计较。\n得他来，立见効。\n地天泰，爲朕兆。\n口对口，窍对窍。\n吞入腹，自知道。\n药苗新，先天兆。\n审眉间，行逆道。\n滓质物，自继绍。\n二者余，方绝妙。\n要行持，令人叫。\n气要坚，神莫耗。\n若不行，空老耄。\n认得真，老还少。\n不知音，莫语要。\n此儿法，合大道。\n精气神，不老药。\n静里全，明中报。\n乘凤鸾，听天诏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47689.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47689","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}